UC-1.2 Update Patient Information

mysql> select * from patients
    -> where patient_id = 1;
+------------+-------------+------------+------------+----------+-------------+---------------------------+
| patient_id | name        | dob        | phone      | address  | blood_group | email                     |
+------------+-------------+------------+------------+----------+-------------+---------------------------+
|          1 | Arya Mishra | 2004-09-24 | 8838109562 | Jabalpur | O+          | aryaamishra0001@gmail.com |
+------------+-------------+------------+------------+----------+-------------+---------------------------+

mysql> update patients
    -> set address = 'Indore',
    -> phone = '9876549999'
    -> where patient_id = 1;
Query OK

mysql> select * from patients;
+------------+-----------------+------------+------------+---------+-------------+----------------------------+
| patient_id | name            | dob        | phone      | address | blood_group | email                      |
+------------+-----------------+------------+------------+---------+-------------+----------------------------+
